SUMMARY:The Hedge Fund Landscape: Risk Mitigation\, AI Integration\, and Mega Funds
DESCRIPTION:OverviewThis panel explores how institutional investors are positioning hedge fund allocations within a total portfolio framework\, examining shifting demand\, manager selection dynamics\, market competition\, and the growing role of AI in investment strategies and the evolving hedge fund landscape. \n\n  \n    🎯 Target Audience\n  \n  \n    Senior leaders in investment management\, including investment officers and investment analysts.\n   \n\n  \n    Key Discussion Topics\n  \n\n  \n\n    \n      \n        📊\n      \n      \n        Portfolio Integration: How institutional allocators are deploying hedge funds to manage risk\, enhance diversification\, and drive total portfolio returns.\n       \n    \n\n    \n      \n        🔥\n      \n      \n        In-Demand Strategies: The primary hedge fund strategies currently attracting the most capital from US institutional investors.\n       \n    \n\n    \n      \n        🏛️\n      \n      \n        Large Manager Dominance: How the flight to scale gives established mega-managers greater leverage to command higher management fees and enforce longer lockup terms.\n       \n    \n\n    \n      \n        🚀\n      \n      \n        The Emerging Manager Edge: Strategies emerging and boutique managers are using to compete with industry giants for institutional mindshare and capital.\n       \n    \n\n  \nAgenda5:30 PM | REGISTRATION \n\nIntroduction by: Yoshiko Yamaguchi\, CFA\, Founder and CEO\, Soya Japan \n5:55 PM | KEYNOTE SPEAKER \nChris Mandas\, CFA\, CAIA\, Director\, Hedge Funds\, Cliffwater \n\n6:15 PM | PANEL DISCUSSION \nPanelists \nJames Bell\, Senior Consultant & Director – Hedge Fund Research\, Crewcial Partners \nEvan Frazier\, CFA\,CAIA\, Senior Research Analyst\, Marquette Associates  \nTetiana Kyslytsyna\, CAIA\, Hedge Fund Investment Specialist\, UBS Unified Global Alternatives  \nChris Mandas\, CFA\, CAIA\, Director\, Hedge Funds\, Cliffwater \nColleen Silver\, CFA\, Head of Alternative Investment Product\, Truist Wealth \n\n6:45 PM | Q&A  \n\n6:55 PM | CLOSING REMARKS \nScott Treacy\, CFA\, Senior Associate\, Campion Capital \n\n7:00 PM | NETWORKING RECEPTION
URL:https://cfany.org/event/the-hedge-fund-landscape-risk-mitigation-ai-integration-and-mega-funds/
LOCATION:Hybrid-CFA Society NY\, 1540 Broadway\, 10th Fl\, New York\, NY\, 10036\, United States
CATEGORIES:Alternative Investments,CFA Society NY Event,Conference / Seminar,Interest Group,Virtual Events & Programming
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://cfany.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ChatGPT-Image-Sep-23-2026-04_42_20-PM.png
