SUMMARY:Professional Development & Leadership Group Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Group DescriptionThe Professional Development & Leadership (PDL) Volunteer Interest Group plays a critical role in helping investment professionals successfully navigate career transitions\, build leadership skills\, and future-proof themselves in a rapidly changing industry. This group is designed for professionals exploring career transitions\, mentoring opportunities\, seeking leadership opportunities\, strengthening workplace skills\, or simply building their long-term career strategy. Given the evolution of the investment profession\, impacted by technology\, globalization\, regulatory changes\, and new skill demands\, career development has become an increasingly urgent priority.\n\n\n\nFor our November 12th meeting\, the topic will be negotiation skills. This session will be an introduction and primer on negotiation. The 60-minute session will focus on what is “negotiation” and the types of negotiations\, and the personas of negotiation.  The session will cover pre-negotiation mindset\, preparation\, and defining desired and acceptable objectives or outcomes.\n\n\n  \nJOIN THIS GROUP
