SUMMARY:4th Annual CWIM Global Summit: “Connect\, Collaborate\, Celebrate 2026” (Co-Hosted by CFA Societies Mexico\, New York\, Singapore\, Switzerland)
DESCRIPTION:OverviewCollaborative WIM’s final event of the year — the fourth annual Global Summit —will take place virtually on Thursday\, November 19th between 12:00PM – 4:30PM EST. Co-hosted by CFA Societies Mexico\, New York\, Singapore\, and Switzerland\, alongside Collaborative WIM\, this complimentary half-day event will bring together a global community of investment professionals\, industry leaders\, and emerging voices across finance. \nDesigned to inspire meaningful dialogue and connection\, the summit will feature thought-provoking conversations\, interactive discussions\, and actionable insights focused on leadership\, career growth\, innovation\, and the evolving future of the investment industry. \nWhat You’ll Gain\n\nActionable insights to support your professional growth and personal development \nHear from global changemakers and industry leaders driving impact across organizations and markets \nEngage in live discussions with peers from around the world and expand your global network \nExplore new perspectives on leadership\, collaboration\, and the future of finance \n\nWe encourage you to invite your colleagues and peers to join this dynamic and interactive global experience. Gain actionable insights to guide your career journey and personal development as you gather for an inspiring virtual half-day event: the fourth annual Collaborative WIM Global Summit! \nFor more information\, please email team@collaborativewim.org.\nCFA Institute Qualified Activity: Eligible for 4.5 PL credit hours \nCWIM Event SitePresented By:
URL:https://cfany.org/event/4th-annual-cwim-global-summit-connect-collaborate-celebrate-2026-co-hosted-by-cfa-societies-mexico-new-york-singapore-switzerland/
