SUMMARY:2026 Annual Employment Outlook
DESCRIPTION:OverviewThe Annual Employment Outlook is a must-attend event for CFA Society New York members and non-members poised for career transitions. Whether you’re actively seeking a new role or laying the groundwork for future opportunities\, this event provides essential knowledge and perspectives. Dive into the latest industry trends and gain a competitive edge with guidance from top financial sector leaders.  \nAgenda5:30 PM | REGISTRATION \n\n5:55 PM | INTRODUCTION \n \n\n6:00 PM | EMPLOYMENT PANEL DISCUSSION \nModerator \nLiliana Kleyman\, CFA\, Finance Manager\, XTX Markets \nPanelists  \nMary Kate Arturi\, Managing Director\, Head of Financial Services and Investment Management\, True Search \n\n6:50 PM | Q&A \n\n6:55 PM | CLOSING REMARKS \n\n7:00 PM | NETWORKING RECEPTION \nAdditional DetailsLearning Outcomes \n\nUnderstanding Market Dynamics\nPredicting Future Trends\nNetworking and Collaboration\nSkill Alignment and Enhancement
