SUMMARY:Insurance Company Chief Investment Officer Roundtable
DESCRIPTION:OverviewAn Asset Owner Series™ Event \nA marquee event featuring discussion by Insurance Company Chief Investment Officers on how the insurance industry manages political and economic uncertainty\, asset allocation strategies\, and best practices in Liability Driven Investing (LDI). \nLDI is a highly specialized strategy requiring unique skills\, a long-term perspective\, and ongoing protection against inflation\, volatility\, and interest rate risk. Hear how some of the market’s most prominent practitioners manage these challenges and maximize opportunities for their portfolios. \nPanelists will include Met Life\, HarbourVest\, Sunlife and others. Attendees include AMICA\, Global Atlantic\, Enstar\, the Hartford\, Liberty Mutual\, Manulife\, New York Life\, QBE\, CV Starr\, TIAA\, Zurich. \nAgenda5:30 PM | REGISTRATION \n\n6:00 PM | INTRODUCTION \n\n6:05 PM | PANEL DISCUSSION \nModerator \nMadhavi Chugh\, CFA\, Global C-Head of Insurance\, MetLife Investment Management \nPanelist \n Bill Cole\, CFA\, CAIA\, Principal and Private Credit Specialist\, HarbourVest \nKerry O’Brien\, Head of Multi-Asset Solutions\, MetLife Investment Management \n\n7:00 PM | Q&A \n\n7:10 PM | CLOSING REMARKS \n\n7:15 PM | NETWORKING RECEPTION \nGold Sponsors:Silver Sponsors:
URL:https://cfany.org/event/insurance-company-chief-investment-officer-roundtable/
