SUMMARY:Wealth Management Group Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Group DescriptionThe Wealth Management (WM) Volunteer Interest Group is a dynamic community dedicated to advancing the expertise\, professionalism\, and innovation of finance professionals serving high-net-worth individuals\, families\, and themselves. Wealth management requires more than just investment expertise—it demands holistic solutions integrating portfolio management\, estate planning\, tax strategies\, behavioral finance\, and risk management. Our mission is to foster a collaborative and forward-thinking environment where investment professionals can enhance their expertise\, engage with top industry leaders\, stay ahead of market trends\, exchange best practices\, and develop leadership opportunities within the CFA Society New York Community. Through roundtables\, workshops\, networking\, and research contributions\, we provide unparalleled access to exclusive insights and a powerful network of professionals shaping the future of wealth management. Our members include professionals seeking to deepen their knowledge and impact. Whether you are an experienced professional or new to the field\, WM empowers you to grow\, lead\, and thrive in delivering exceptional client solutions. \nJoin Group
URL:https://cfany.org/event/wealth-management-group-meeting-21/
LOCATION:Virtual Only
